A '''hyperlane''' branched off the [[Hydian Way]] at [[Fedalle]] and headed eastward to [[Lespectus]], [[Kuat]],<ref name="Map" /> [[Balmorra]],<ref name="TFABG" /> [[Neimoidia]], and then southward to join<ref name="Map" /> the [[Trellen Trade Route]]<ref name="Trellen" /> just west of [[Commenor]].<ref name="Map" /> 

{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The partwork magazine issue [[Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon 52|''Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon'' 52]] places the [[planet]] Neimoidia on the Trellen Trade Route,<ref name="BMF">{{BuildFalconCite|52|Guide to the Galaxy}}</ref> but that name applied to a different route in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, and the route between Fedalle and Kuat was never named. [[Jason Fry]], author of ''[[The Essential Atlas]]''<ref name="Atlas">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref> and a number of maps in the [[canon]] continuity,<ref name="AVG">''[[Star Wars: The Acolyte: The Visual Guide]]''</ref> has stated that this should be treated as an error.<ref name="Fry">{{EmailCite|email=File:AtlasEmail-2025-08-31.png|creator=[[Jason Fry]]|date=2025-08-31}}</ref>

